
            <div id="loadlink">
                <p><a>Open this file in the Lurch web app</a></p>
                <script language="javascript">
                    const link = document.querySelector( '#loadlink > p > a' )
                    const thisURL = encodeURIComponent( window.location.href )
                    link?.setAttribute( 'href', 'https://lurch.plus/instructor.html?load=' + thisURL )
                </script>
            </div>
        
            <div id="metadata" style="display: none;"></div>
            <div id="document"><h1>Welcome to the Lurch Discussion Files</h1>
<p>This repository is a place to store example Lurch documents so that they can be linked to in forum discussions like those in the <a title="Lurch" href="https://code4math.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/416474-Lurch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lurch channel at code4math</a>.&nbsp; This allows sharing a link such as&nbsp;</p>
<p><code>https://lurch.plus/instructor.html?load=https://kenmonks.github.io/lurch-discussion-files/welcome.lurch</code></p>
<p>to a file such that it will open directly in Lurch when a user clicks on it.&nbsp;</p></div>
        